"""Knowledge-base seed: pitfalls, rules of thumb, writing guides, common deficiencies, checklist rationale and
regulatory pointers distilled from the method-development guidance (ICH Q14/Q2(R2)/Q9(R1)/M10, FDA 2015/2023/2024)
and the CD19/CD22 CAR flow case.

Honesty rule: clause/section numbers appear only where they were checked against the guideline text in
法规文件/；otherwise the document is cited by title and the source carries "（条款待核对）".  Items of kind
"pitfall" tagged 常见缺陷 are empirical syntheses of typical review/inspection comments, not regulatory text.

kind values are limited to those the web UI knows: rule / pitfall / howto / reference (lesson is user-created).
Tags used for grouping: 写作指南 (how to write a chapter), 常见缺陷 (common deficiencies), 检查清单依据 (checklist rationale)."""

ALL = ["all"]


def K(kind, title, body, techniques=None, stages=None, tags=None, source=""):
    return {"kind": kind, "title": title, "body": body, "techniques": techniques or ALL, "stages": stages or [],
            "tags": tags or [], "source": source}


